  "label": "Microphone as Political Symbol",
  "description": "The microphone is a symbol of public speaking and official communication, often used in political settings such as press conferences or official addresses. The presence of the microphone in the image reinforces the formal political setting and adds to the credibility of the scene, which is then used to imply that the false claims are legitimate or official.",
